msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:0
msgid "rl_games"
msgstr "`rl_games`"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:0
msgid "skrl"
msgstr "`skrl`"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:0
msgid "sb3"
msgstr "sb3"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:91
msgid ""
"The above command will run training with the task ``Isaac-Cartpole`` without"
" selecting a visualizer, and set the ``env.actions.joint_effort.scale`` "
"parameter to 10.0 and the ``agent.seed`` parameter to 2024."
msgstr ""
"上述命令训练 ``Isaac-Cartpole`` 任务，不选择可视化器，并将 ``env.actions.joint_effort.scale`` "
"设为 10.0、 ``agent.seed`` 设为 2024。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:96
msgid ""
"To keep backwards compatibility, and to provide a more user-friendly "
"experience, we have kept the old cli arguments of the form ``--param``, for "
"example ``--num_envs``, ``--seed``, ``--max_iterations``. These arguments "
"have precedence over the hydra arguments, and will overwrite the values set "
"by the hydra arguments."
msgstr ""
"为了保持向后兼容性，并提供更友好的用户体验，我们保留了旧的 cli 参数形式 ``--param`` ，例如 ``--num_envs`` 、 "
"``--seed`` 、 ``--max_iterations`` 。这些参数优先于 hydra 参数，并将覆盖由 hydra 参数设置的值。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:102
msgid "Modifying advanced parameters"
msgstr "修改高级参数"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:105
msgid "Callables"
msgstr "可调用对象"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:107
msgid ""
"It is possible to modify functions and classes in the configuration files by"
" using the syntax ``module:attribute_name``. For example, in the Cartpole "
"environment:"
msgstr "可以通过使用语法 ``module:attribute_name`` 修改配置文件中的函数和类。例如，在 Cartpole 环境中: "

#: source/features/hydra.rst:116
msgid ""
"we could modify ``joint_pos_rel`` to compute absolute positions instead of "
"relative positions with "
"``env.observations.policy.joint_pos_rel.func=isaaclab.envs.mdp:joint_pos``."
msgstr ""
"我们可以修改 ``joint_pos_rel`` 以计算绝对位置，而不是相对位置，使用 "
"``env.observations.policy.joint_pos_rel.func=isaaclab.envs.mdp:joint_pos`` 。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:120
msgid "Setting parameters to None"
msgstr "将参数设置为 None"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:122
msgid ""
"To set parameters to None, use the ``null`` keyword, which is a special "
"keyword in Hydra that is automatically converted to None. In the above "
"example, we could also disable the ``joint_pos_rel`` observation by setting "
"it to None with ``env.observations.policy.joint_pos_rel=null``."
msgstr ""
"要将参数设置为 None，请使用 ``null`` 关键字，这是 Hydra 中的一个特殊关键字，会自动转换为 "
"None。在上面的示例中，我们还可以通过将 ``env.observations.policy.joint_pos_rel=null`` 设置为 "
"None 来禁用 ``joint_pos_rel`` 观测。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:127
msgid "Dictionaries"
msgstr "字典"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:128
msgid ""
"Elements in dictionaries are handled as parameters in the hierarchy. For "
"example, in the Cartpole environment:"
msgstr "字典中的元素作为配置层级中的参数处理。例如，在 Cartpole 环境中："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:135
msgid ""
"the ``position_range`` parameter can be modified with "
"``env.events.reset_cart_position.params.position_range=\"[-2.0, 2.0]\"``. "
"This example shows two noteworthy points:"
msgstr ""
"``position_range`` 参数可以通过 "
"``env.events.reset_cart_position.params.position_range=\"[-2.0, 2.0]\"`` "
"进行修改。这个例子展示了两个值得注意的点: "

#: source/features/hydra.rst:138
msgid ""
"The value contains a space, so it must be enclosed in quotes for the shell."
msgstr "该值包含空格，因此必须用引号括起，供 shell 正确解析。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:139
msgid ""
"The parameter is a list while it is a tuple in the config. This is due to "
"the fact that Hydra does not support tuples."
msgstr "参数是一个列表，而在 config 中它是一个元组。这是因为 Hydra 不支持元组。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:143
msgid "Modifying inter-dependent parameters"
msgstr "修改高级参数"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:145
msgid ""
"Particular care should be taken when modifying the parameters using command "
"line arguments. Some of the configurations perform intermediate computations"
" based on other parameters. These computations will not be updated when the "
"parameters are modified."
msgstr "在使用命令行参数修改参数时应特别小心。一些配置会根据其他参数执行中间计算。这些计算在参数被修改时不会更新。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:149
msgid "For example, for the configuration of the Cartpole camera environment:"
msgstr "例如，Cartpole 相机环境的配置："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:156
msgid ""
"The configuration declares the single-frame channel count and a default "
"spatial size. At environment initialization, ``CartpoleCameraEnv`` rebuilds "
"``observation_space`` from the resolved camera: the default "
"``frame_stack=2`` expands channels, and height/width are taken from "
"``scene.tiled_camera``. So ``env.scene.tiled_camera.width=128 "
"env.scene.tiled_camera.height=128`` alone yields an effective stacked shape "
"of ``[6,128,128]`` without also overriding ``env.observation_space``. The "
"channel entry in ``observation_space`` must still match the camera data type"
" (for example ``[1, ...]`` with ``presets=depth``); presets already set "
"this."
msgstr ""
"配置声明单帧通道数和默认空间尺寸。环境初始化时， ``CartpoleCameraEnv`` 根据解析后的相机重新构建 "
"``observation_space`` ：默认 ``frame_stack=2`` 会扩展通道数，高度和宽度来自 "
"``scene.tiled_camera`` 。因此，仅设置 ``env.scene.tiled_camera.width=128 "
"env.scene.tiled_camera.height=128`` ，就会得到有效的堆叠形状 ``[6,128,128]`` ，无需同时覆盖 "
"``env.observation_space`` 。 ``observation_space`` 中的通道数仍必须匹配相机数据类型（例如 "
"``presets=depth`` 对应 ``[1, ...]`` ）；预设已完成这一设置。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:165
msgid ""
"Class-body assignments are evaluated once at import time and do **not** "
"track later Hydra overrides unless runtime code explicitly rebuilds the "
"dependent value, as this camera environment does."
msgstr ""
"类体中的赋值在导入时只求值一次， **不会** 随后续 Hydra 覆盖自动更新，除非运行时代码显式重新构建依赖值，正如这个相机环境所做的那样。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:169
msgid ""
"Similarly, the ``__post_init__`` method is not updated with the command line"
" inputs. In the ``LocomotionVelocityRoughEnvCfg``, for example, the post "
"init update is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"类似地， ``__post_init__`` 方法不会随着命令行输入而更新。在 ``LocomotionVelocityRoughEnvCfg`` "
"中，例如，post init 更新如下: "

#: source/features/hydra.rst:176
msgid ""
"Here, when modifying ``env.decimation`` or ``env.sim.dt``, the user needs to"
" give the updated ``env.sim.render_interval``, "
"``env.scene.height_scanner.update_period``, and "
"``env.scene.contact_forces.update_period`` as input as well."
msgstr ""
"在这里，当修改 ``env.decimation`` 或 ``env.sim.dt`` 时，用户还需要输入更新后的 "
"``env.sim.render_interval`` 、 ``env.scene.height_scanner.update_period`` 和 "
"``env.scene.contact_forces.update_period`` 。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:181
msgid "Custom Configuration Validation"
msgstr "自定义配置验证"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:183
msgid ""
"Configclass objects can define a ``validate_config()`` method to perform "
"domain-specific validation after all fields have been resolved. This hook is"
" called automatically after preset resolution and MISSING-field checks "
"succeed, allowing you to catch invalid parameter combinations early with "
"clear error messages."
msgstr ""
"Configclass 对象可以定义 ``validate_config()`` 方法，在所有字段解析后执行领域相关验证。预设解析和 MISSING "
"字段检查成功后会自动调用该钩子，使你能尽早发现无效参数组合，并提供明确的错误信息。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:188
msgid ""
"For example, the Franka reach configuration validates that its Newton IK "
"action preset is paired with a Newton physics configuration:"
msgstr "例如，Franka 到达任务配置会验证 Newton IK 动作预设是否与 Newton 物理配置配合使用："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:196
msgid "**When it runs:**"
msgstr "**执行时机：**"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:198
msgid ""
"All ``MISSING`` fields are checked first — if any remain, ``TypeError`` is "
"raised."
msgstr "先检查所有 ``MISSING`` 字段；仍有缺失时抛出 ``TypeError`` 。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:199
msgid ""
"Only then is ``validate_config()`` called on the **top-level** config "
"object."
msgstr "只有此后，才在 **顶层** 配置对象上调用 ``validate_config()`` 。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:200
msgid ""
"The hook should raise ``ValueError`` with a clear message and migration "
"guidance."
msgstr "该钩子应抛出 ``ValueError`` ，并给出明确说明和迁移建议。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:202
msgid "**Common validation patterns:**"
msgstr "**常见验证内容：**"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:204
msgid ""
"Compatibility between independently selectable controllers, physics "
"configurations, and renderers"
msgstr "独立选择的控制器、物理配置和渲染器之间的兼容性"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:205
msgid "Renderer, camera data type, and feature extractor compatibility"
msgstr "渲染器、相机数据类型和特征提取器的兼容性"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:206
msgid ""
"Numeric relationships or limits that cannot be expressed by field types "
"alone"
msgstr "仅靠字段类型无法表达的数值关系或限制"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:210
msgid "Preset System"
msgstr "预设系统"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:212
msgid ""
"For a user-focused introduction to choosing physics, rendering, and task "
"variants, start with :doc:`/source/concepts/backends_and_presets`. This "
"section covers the complete preset definition and resolution behavior."
msgstr ""
"若想从使用者角度了解如何选择物理、渲染和任务变体，请先阅读 :doc:`/source/concepts/backends_and_presets` "
"。本节介绍完整的预设定义和解析行为。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:216
msgid ""
"The preset system lets you swap out entire config sections -- or individual "
"scalar values -- with a single command line argument. Instead of overriding "
"individual fields, you select a named preset that **completely replaces** "
"the config section (no field merging)."
msgstr ""
"预设系统允许通过一个命令行参数替换整个配置部分，或单个标量值。无需逐字段覆盖，只需选择命名预设，即可 **完全替换** 对应配置部分（不合并字段）。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:221
msgid ""
"Presets are declared by subclassing "
":class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg` or by using the "
":func:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.preset` convenience factory. The system "
"recursively discovers all presets from nested configs automatically, "
"including presets inside dict-valued fields (e.g. ``actuators``)."
msgstr ""
"预设通过继承 :class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg` ，或使用便捷工厂 "
":func:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.preset` "
"声明。系统自动从嵌套配置中递归发现全部预设，包括字典字段内的预设（例如 ``actuators`` ）。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:228
msgid "Override Order"
msgstr "覆盖顺序"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:230
msgid "The effective precedence, from lowest to highest, is:"
msgstr "实际优先级从低到高为："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:232
msgid ""
"**Defaults**: Each unresolved ``PresetCfg`` falls back to its ``default`` "
"field."
msgstr "**默认值** ：未解析的 ``PresetCfg`` 回退到各自的 ``default`` 字段。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:233
msgid ""
"**Typed and domain selections**: ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` selects physics "
"while ``presets=rgb`` broadcasts a task-specific name to every matching "
"config."
msgstr ""
"**带类型和领域选择** ： ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` 选择物理配置， ``presets=rgb`` "
"将任务特有名称广播到所有匹配配置。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:235
msgid ""
"**Path selections**: ``env.sim.physics=newton_kamino`` targets one specific "
"``PresetCfg`` and takes precedence at that path."
msgstr ""
"**路径选择** ： ``env.sim.physics=newton_kamino`` 定位一个具体的 ``PresetCfg`` "
"，并在该路径上优先生效。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:237
msgid ""
"**Play-mode changes**: When requested by a play command, the environment's "
"``play_mode()`` changes are applied to the resolved config."
msgstr "**回放模式修改** ：回放命令请求时，将环境的 ``play_mode()`` 修改应用到解析后的配置。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:239
msgid ""
"**Scalar overrides**: ``env.sim.dt=0.001`` has the final say for an "
"individual field."
msgstr "**标量覆盖** ： ``env.sim.dt=0.001`` 对单个字段具有最终决定权。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:241
msgid ""
"If multiple broadcast names select different alternatives at the same active"
" path, resolution fails instead of silently choosing one."
msgstr "如果多个广播名称在同一有效路径上选择不同选项，解析会失败，而不是静默选择其中一个。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:246
msgid "Defining Presets with PresetCfg"
msgstr "使用 PresetCfg 定义预设"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:248
msgid ""
"Create a :class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg` subclass where each "
"field is a named alternative. The ``default`` field is the config used when "
"no CLI override is given:"
msgstr ""
"创建 :class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg` "
"子类，将每个字段定义为一个命名选项。没有命令行覆盖时，使用 ``default`` 字段指定的配置："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:270
msgid ""
"Physics is owned by :class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg`, so the preset's "
"config path is ``env.sim.physics``. For backend selection, prefer the typed "
"selector:"
msgstr ""
"物理由 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` 管理，因此预设配置路径是 ``env.sim.physics`` "
"。选择后端时优先使用带类型选择器："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:278
msgid ""
"Use the path form ``env.sim.physics=newton_mjwarp`` only when you "
"intentionally want to replace that one preset node without selecting other "
"matching task presets."
msgstr ""
"只有明确希望替换这一个预设节点、而不选择其他匹配的任务预设时，才使用路径形式 ``env.sim.physics=newton_mjwarp`` 。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:281
msgid ""
"The ``default`` field can be set to ``None`` to make an optional feature "
"that is disabled unless explicitly selected:"
msgstr "将 ``default`` 字段设为 ``None`` ，可定义默认关闭、只有显式选择才启用的可选功能："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:301
msgid ""
"Here, ``env.scene.camera`` resolves to ``None`` by default. A registered "
"task using this config can activate the large camera with the path selector "
"``env.scene.camera=large``."
msgstr ""
"此处 ``env.scene.camera`` 默认解析为 ``None`` 。使用该配置的已注册任务可以通过路径选择器 "
"``env.scene.camera=large`` 启用大相机。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:309
msgid "Backend and Solver Presets"
msgstr "后端与求解器预设"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:311
msgid ""
"Physics backend selection uses the same preset system. A task can define a "
"``PresetCfg`` whose entries replace the complete physics config:"
msgstr "物理后端选择使用同一预设系统。任务可以定义 ``PresetCfg`` ，各条目替换完整物理配置："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:314
msgid "The Cartpole task's definition is a maintained example:"
msgstr "Cartpole 任务中的定义是一个持续维护的示例："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:321
msgid ""
"The ``newton_mjwarp`` and ``newton_kamino`` entries both select the Newton "
"physics backend because both entries are "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` objects. The difference is the "
"solver configuration: ``newton_mjwarp`` uses "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.MJWarpSolverCfg`, while ``newton_kamino`` "
"uses :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoPADMMSolverCfg`."
msgstr ""
"``newton_mjwarp`` 和 ``newton_kamino`` 均选择 Newton 物理后端，因为两者都是 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.NewtonCfg` 对象。区别在于求解器配置： ``newton_mjwarp`` "
"使用 :class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.MJWarpSolverCfg` ， ``newton_kamino`` 使用 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.physics.KaminoPADMMSolverCfg` 。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:327
msgid ""
"Kamino is therefore a solver preset, not a separate Isaac Lab backend. The "
"same Newton assets, sensors, renderers, and visualizers are used after the "
"preset is resolved. It is a Proximal Alternating Direction Method of "
"Multipliers (P-ADMM) based solver for constrained rigid multi-body dynamics,"
" and its Isaac Lab support is currently beta."
msgstr ""
"因此，Kamino 是求解器预设，而非独立的 Isaac Lab 后端。预设解析后，使用相同的 Newton "
"资产、传感器、渲染器和可视化器。它是基于近端交替方向乘子法（P-ADMM）的约束刚性多体动力学求解器，在 Isaac Lab 中的支持目前处于 beta"
" 阶段。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:335
msgid ""
"Kamino support is experimental and currently depends on the asset being "
"structured in a way that Kamino can consume. Assets that work with the "
"MuJoCo-Warp or PhysX presets may still require model-structure updates "
"before they work with ``physics=newton_kamino``."
msgstr ""
"Kamino 支持仍具有实验性质，目前要求资产结构能够被 Kamino 读取。适用于 MuJoCo-Warp 或 PhysX "
"预设的资产，可能仍需调整模型结构才能用于 ``physics=newton_kamino`` 。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:350
msgid ""
"Backend support is task-specific and changes as tasks are validated. Use the"
" task's ``--help`` output as the source of truth. Passing "
"``physics=newton_kamino`` to a task that does not advertise it fails; it "
"does not add a Kamino configuration to that task."
msgstr ""
"后端支持范围取决于具体任务，并会随验证进展变化，以任务的 ``--help`` 输出为准。向未列出该预设的任务传入 "
"``physics=newton_kamino`` 会失败，不会自动为该任务添加 Kamino 配置。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:357
msgid "Inline Presets with preset()"
msgstr "通过 preset() 定义内联预设"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:359
msgid ""
"For simple values (scalars, lists) that don't warrant a full subclass, use "
"the :func:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.preset` factory. It dynamically "
"creates a ``PresetCfg`` instance from keyword arguments:"
msgstr ""
"对于不值得单独定义完整子类的简单值（标量、列表），使用 :func:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.preset` "
"工厂。它根据关键字参数动态创建 ``PresetCfg`` 实例："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:372
msgid ""
"This is equivalent to defining a ``PresetCfg`` subclass with the same "
"``float`` fields, but without the ceremony. The ``default`` keyword is "
"required."
msgstr ""
"这等价于定义包含相同 ``float`` 字段的 ``PresetCfg`` 子类，但写法更简洁。必须提供 ``default`` 关键字。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:375
msgid ""
"``preset()`` works for any value type -- scalars, lists, or even config "
"instances:"
msgstr "``preset()`` 适用于任意值类型，包括标量、列表，甚至配置实例："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:390
msgid ""
"Use ``preset()`` when the definition fits on a single line. Use a "
"``PresetCfg`` subclass when the options are verbose enough to benefit from "
"type annotations and multiline formatting."
msgstr "定义可以写在一行时，使用 ``preset()`` 。选项较复杂、需要类型注解和多行排版时，使用 ``PresetCfg`` 子类。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:394
msgid ""
"The preset system discovers ``preset()`` values anywhere in the config tree,"
" including inside dict-valued fields such as ``actuators``:"
msgstr "预设系统会发现配置树中任意位置的 ``preset()`` 值，包括 ``actuators`` 等字典字段内部："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:403
msgid ""
"The typed ``physics=`` selector uses broadcast resolution for the selected "
"name, so matching task-specific alternatives such as this armature value are"
" updated too. It additionally verifies that the name resolved a physics "
"configuration; the free-form ``presets=`` selector does not provide that "
"type check."
msgstr ""
"带类型的 ``physics=`` "
"选择器按所选名称进行广播解析，因此具有相同名称的任务选项（例如这里的电枢惯量值）也会更新。它还验证该名称确实解析出了物理配置；自由形式的 "
"``presets=`` 选择器不提供这一类型检查。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:410
msgid "Typed Preset Selectors"
msgstr "带类型的预设选择器"

