msgid ""
"The preset CLI layer recognizes three ``key=value`` tokens (no leading "
"dashes) that can be appended to any training or play script command:"
msgstr "预设命令行层识别三种 ``key=value`` 参数（不带前导短横线），可附加到任意训练或回放脚本命令后："

