"Typed selector for :class:`~isaaclab.renderers.renderer_cfg.RendererCfg` "
"variants"
msgstr "用于选择 :class:`~isaaclab.renderers.renderer_cfg.RendererCfg` 变体的带类型选择器"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:425
msgid "``presets=NAME[,NAME,...]``"
msgstr "``presets=NAME[,NAME,...]``"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:426
msgid ""
"Broadcast: applied to every matching "
":class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg` in the config tree"
msgstr "广播：应用到配置树中每个匹配的 :class:`~isaaclab_tasks.utils.hydra.PresetCfg`"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:428
msgid ""
"The typed selectors use the same broadcast resolution as ``presets=``. This "
"means ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` can also update dependent task presets with "
"the same name, such as actuator or event settings. They are not "
"interchangeable, however: a typed selector must resolve at least one config "
"of its declared type or it raises an error. Use ``physics=`` and "
"``renderer=`` for backend choices, and reserve ``presets=`` for task-"
"specific modes."
msgstr ""
"带类型选择器采用与 ``presets=`` 相同的广播解析。因此 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` "
"也可以更新具有相同名称的依赖任务预设，例如执行器或事件设置。但它们并不等价：带类型选择器必须解析出至少一个声明类型的配置，否则报错。后端选择使用 "
"``physics=`` 和 ``renderer=`` ，任务特有模式使用 ``presets=`` 。"

