#: source/features/hydra.rst:472
msgid ""
"The implicit ``default`` field is task-specific and is intentionally omitted"
" from ``--help``. Do not infer a task's default backend from these "
"conventional names; inspect its help output or configuration. Automatic "
"choices such as ``physics=physx`` and ``renderer=rtx`` are opt-in, not "
"universal defaults."
msgstr ""
"隐含的 ``default`` 字段由任务决定，并有意不在 ``--help`` 中列出。不要根据这些惯用名称推断任务默认后端，应查看帮助输出或配置。 "
"``physics=physx`` 和 ``renderer=rtx`` 等自动选择需显式启用，并非通用默认值。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:477
msgid ""
"Domain presets (observation modes, camera configurations, etc.) are task-"
"specific. Pass ``--task=<task-name> --help`` to a training command to see "
"all presets available for that task, grouped by selector type."
msgstr ""
"领域预设（观测模式、相机配置等）取决于任务。向训练命令传入 ``--task=<task-name> --help`` "
"，可查看按选择器类型分组的全部可用任务预设。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:481
msgid ""
"For reinforcement-learning tasks, preset resolution composes the registered "
"environment and agent configurations as sibling roots. A library's canonical"
" ``<library>_cfg_entry_point`` may therefore return a root-level "
"``PresetCfg`` with the same alternative names as the environment. A "
"broadcast such as ``presets=resnet18`` selects ``resnet18`` in both roots in"
" one resolution pass:"
msgstr ""
"对于强化学习任务，预设解析将已注册的环境和智能体配置组合为同级根节点。因此，库的规范 ``<library>_cfg_entry_point`` "
"可以返回根级 ``PresetCfg`` ，包含与环境相同名称的选项。 ``presets=resnet18`` "
"这样的广播会在一次解析中，在两个根节点上都选择 ``resnet18`` ："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:503
msgid ""
"This is the preferred way to keep an environment-coupled policy shape, such "
"as a feature extractor or action-space head, aligned with the selected "
"environment. It does not require a preset-specific registry entry or rewrite"
" ``--agent``."
msgstr ""
"这是使依赖环境的策略形状（例如特征提取器或动作空间输出头）与所选环境保持一致的推荐方式，无需预设专属的注册条目，也无需改写 ``--agent`` 。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:507
msgid ""
"Independent training recipes remain explicit agent choices. A task may "
"select an alternate agent for symmetry, recurrence, distillation, or another"
" algorithm without changing its environment preset."
msgstr "独立的训练方案仍通过显式选择智能体来指定。任务可以为对称性、循环网络、蒸馏或其他算法选择不同智能体，而不改变环境预设。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:511
msgid ""
"Preset-specific agent entry points and registry-side preset-to-agent maps "
"are not part of this model. Use the canonical entry point and select its "
"variant with ``presets=``. For older SKRL runs whose manifest or directory "
"encoded a configuration-key suffix instead of ``agent.class`` as the "
"algorithm, pass the checkpoint path explicitly instead of using automatic "
"``latest`` or ``best`` discovery."
msgstr ""
"该模型不使用预设专属的智能体入口，也不在注册表端维护预设到智能体的映射。应使用规范入口，并通过 ``presets=`` 选择变体。对于旧版 SKRL "
"运行，如果其清单或目录以配置键后缀而非 ``agent.class`` 表示算法，请显式传入检查点路径，不要使用自动 ``latest`` 或 "
"``best`` 发现。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:520
msgid ""
"Legacy aliases ``newton`` → ``newton_mjwarp`` and ``kamino`` → "
"``newton_kamino`` are still accepted but emit a :class:`FutureWarning`. The "
"renderer aliases ``isaacsim_rtx_renderer`` → ``isaacsim_rtx`` and "
"``ovrtx_renderer`` → ``ovrtx`` behave the same way. Prefer the canonical "
"names."
msgstr ""
"旧别名 ``newton`` → ``newton_mjwarp`` 和 ``kamino`` → ``newton_kamino`` "
"仍可使用，但会发出 :class:`FutureWarning` 。渲染器别名 ``isaacsim_rtx_renderer`` → "
"``isaacsim_rtx`` 和 ``ovrtx_renderer`` → ``ovrtx`` 也如此。请优先使用规范名称。"

