#: source/features/hydra.rst:596
msgid "Real-World Example"
msgstr "实际示例"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:598
msgid ""
"The ANYmal-C locomotion environment shows both ``PresetCfg`` and "
"``preset()`` working together:"
msgstr "ANYmal-C 运动环境展示了 ``PresetCfg`` 与 ``preset()`` 的配合使用："

#: source/features/hydra.rst:605
msgid ""
"The base velocity configuration also defines ``newton_mjwarp`` alternatives "
"for physics and a center-of-mass randomization event that MJWarp disables. "
"An explicit ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` resolves the physics config and every "
"active dependent alternative with that name: the event is disabled and the "
"ANYmal-C actuator armature becomes ``0.01``. The typed selector also "
"verifies that a physics preset was actually selected."
msgstr ""
"基础速度配置还为物理和质心随机化事件定义了 ``newton_mjwarp`` 选项，MJWarp 会禁用该事件。显式设置 "
"``physics=newton_mjwarp`` ，会解析物理配置及具有同名的所有有效依赖选项：禁用该事件，并将 ANYmal-C 执行器电枢惯量设为"
" ``0.01`` 。带类型选择器还会验证确实选中了物理预设。"

#: source/features/hydra.rst:617
msgid ""
"Without a selector, each ``PresetCfg`` independently uses its own "
"``default``; the name of a default alternative is not broadcast to other "
"preset nodes."
msgstr "不提供选择器时，各 ``PresetCfg`` 独立使用自己的 ``default`` ；默认选项的名称不会广播到其他预设节点。"

